# Checked out with LF everywhere (Windows too): hashed and size-checked files (e.g. the VRM bundle) stay byte-identical.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.vrm binary
*.vrma binary
*.wav binary
# Preserve upstream GLSL string whitespace in the generated browser bundle.
public/noa-vrm-avatar.mjs linguist-generated=true -whitespace
